{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q11321962","formula":"C₉H₁₈S₃","hill":"C9H18S3","elements":["H","C","S"],"composition":{"C":9.0,"H":18.0,"S":3.0},"names":{"en":"Hexamethyl-1,3,5-trithiane","uk":"Тритіоацетон"},"descriptions":{"en":"Trithioacetone (2,2,4,4,6,6-hexamethyl-1,3,5-trithiane) is an organic chemical with formula C9H18S3. Its covalent structure is [–C(CH3)2–S–]3, that is, a six-membered ring of alternating carbon and sulfur atoms, with two methyl groups attached to each carbon. It can be viewed as a derivative of 1,3,5-trithiane, with methyl-group substituents for all of the hydrogen atoms in that parent structure.","uk":"Тритіоацетон (2,2,4,4,6,6-гексаметил-1,3,5-тритіан) — органічна сполука з хімічною формулою C9H18S3. Його ковалентна структура [–C(CH3)2–S–]3. тобто шестисегментне кільце з чергуванням атомів вуглецю та сірки з двома метильними групами, приєднаними до кожного вуглецю."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":13233,"mass":222.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1(SC(SC(S1)(C)C)(C)C)C","inchikey":"NBNWHQAWKFYFKI-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"2,2,4,4,6,6-hexamethyl-1,3,5-trithiane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"13233","atoms":30,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.0,"y":-1.963,"z":0.001,"el":"S"},{"x":1.191,"y":0.696,"z":-1.002,"el":"S"},{"x":-1.191,"y":0.697,"z":1.002,"el":"S"},{"x":1.459,"y":-0.851,"z":-0.061,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.46,"y":-0.85,"z":0.061,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":1.656,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":2.521,"y":-1.624,"z":-0.873,"el":"C"},{"x":2.025,"y":-0.636,"z":1.348,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.024,"y":-0.636,"z":-1.348,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.522,"y":-1.623,"z":0.873,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.787,"y":2.568,"z":-0.958,"el":"C"},{"x":0.788,"y":2.568,"z":0.958,"el":"C"},{"x":2.773,"y":-2.582,"z":-0.4,"el":"H"},{"x":2.191,"y":-1.844,"z":-1.897,"el":"H"},{"x":3.461,"y":-1.06,"z":-0.943,